        {
          "text": " Kabalasi eoŋ ebe, “Aatoŋot naasalakinit kotoma aijoreorio ŋina obuku aanyut ican luipu ka amotomoroo: ido abilibilun arwatat naka Yerusalem, iruteike da ecwei kakim.”",
