        {
          "text": " kenera da atiar, “Keŋaiŋait jo, wu EJAKAIT, Edeke loka akuj, Edeke lokapolon lokaŋosibib, loericit aitutuket ka aitim mama kaŋul kalueminas ka arieit da akeicorakineta: ",
