              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kipou keswamata nukasilianut kamakon, kwabo mam kipou karicata aicorakineta, karaida ikisila, karaida itubesia, luibu kicorak ekonikejaanakinan Musa. ",
