              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye arai kiboŋut mamaka, koricenenetc da akaieorakineta, ka aiswemaenen kes, karaida aponi kireŋearai lukus kiton awasia cut naka akuj, konye atukonokini kes kaŋina, kasodi ayaun toma aibois naabu kaseu aisiroikin nen ekakiror.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
