        },
        {
          "text": " Wu EJAKAIT, keŋaiŋait, kiira cabo akonikit ailip naka ekonikejaanakinan, ka ailip da naka ikonikejaanakinak luiyalamas aiyoŋ ekonikiror: keŋaiŋait, kisirereŋ lolo ekonikejaanakinan, koinak aitimio kakonyen nuka etuŋanan kalo,”",
